+/// JavaScript): when a role's draft avoiding `p/**` passed every test of
+/// [`avoid_drafts`] (role scope, upward edge, the Wilson bound), its drafts avoiding
+/// `p/<x>` say less and are dropped. "`lib/**` does not import from `components/**`"
+/// is one rule, not one card per folder of `components`, and it also covers the
+/// folders no single narrow card could show.
+fn widen_layering(drafts: Vec<Draft>) -> Vec<Draft> {
+    if !layer11_on("m1") {
+        return drafts;
+    }
